        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Division 3-Portability forms ",
            "block_bbox": [
                142,
                207,
                576,
                237
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "34A Portability forms ",
            "block_bbox": [
                145,
                273,
                432,
                298
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) For the purposes of standards made under Division 2, and without.limiting that Division, the regulations may prescribe a scheme under which:.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                242,
                323,
                987,
                399
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a) a beneficiary of:",
            "block_bbox": [
                307,
                408,
                532,
                433
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(i) a regulated superannuation fund; or ",
            "block_bbox": [
                367,
                441,
                791,
                464
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(ii) an approved deposit fund;",
            "block_bbox": [
                361,
                474,
                696,
                498
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "gives to the Commissioner of Taxation a request for the.\nbenefits held for the beneficiary in the fund to be rolled-over.\nor transferred; and \n\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                354,
                505,
                1009,
                584
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) the Commissioner may pass the request on to the trustee of the fund..\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                312,
                595,
                1002,
                647
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Note:The standards may require the trustee to act on the request. See paragraphs 31(2)(i) and 32(2)(d).\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                297,
                664,
                971,
                711
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) The regulations may provide that the request must be given to the.Commissioner in the approved form.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                254,
                729,
                1024,
                788
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 10
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Note:The approved form may require the beneficiary to set out his or her tax file number. See subsection 299U(2A).\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                299,
                795,
                1022,
                848
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 11
        },
